 ["A",3,"A large supermarket in Malé sells its own brand of rice, packed for it by a supplier. This is a:",["Store (private) brand","National brand","Co-brand","Licensed brand"],"Store brands are created and owned by the reseller.","2026-10-21T19:12:00+05:00"]
